            <div class="section-label"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i> Transcript</div>
            <span style="font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--brand);font-weight:700;">View <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size:0.6rem;"></i></span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--text-sub);font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;padding:0 4px;">View your complete academic transcript organized by semester.</p>
